<title>USA: Griffon ups buyback program to 3 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Griffon ups buyback program to 3 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>JERICHO, N.Y. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffon Corp said on Wednesday it increased the number of shares it could buy back under its repurchase program to three million shares from 1.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would use proceeds from the sale of its synthetic batting and specialty hardware businesses, estimated at $8 million, to buy shares under the program.</p>
<p>Griffon also said its Employee Stock Ownership Plan would borrow $3 million to make open market purchases of the company's common stock. Purchases would depend on market conditions, Griffon said.</p>
</text>
